# Scope: intention-base theme only

- **Only modify files under this repository root** (`user/themes/intention-base/`).
- Do **not** edit `user/config/`, `user/pages/`, other themes, plugins, `system/`, `vendor/`, or parent `grav-admin/.cursor/`.
- If theme activation or site config is needed, **describe steps for the user**; do not apply them from this workspace.

Examples:

```
✅ templates/partials/base.html.twig
✅ css/partials/main.css
✅ blueprints.yaml
✅ badger-builder/templates/sections/hero.html.twig
✅ .cursor/rules/scope-intention-base.mdc

❌ user/config/system.yaml
❌ user/config/themes/intention-base.yaml
❌ user/plugins/badger-builder/
❌ user/themes/intention/
❌ grav-admin/.cursor/notes/changelog.md
```
